@zgabi — glad to hear it's working in the latest nightly! 🎉

Yes, the import fix was in commit `91963a4` (from the #74 fix). The root cause was that `HandleCollectionChanged` was adding imported nodes at the tree root level instead of as children of the destination container. The fix ensures imported connections appear correctly under their parent folder AND are saved properly.

If import is now working correctly for you, feel free to close this one! 🙏
